@doiiarx/dsh-user-language README · 1. 挂进 web profile：在 `$HOME/.dsh/profiles/web/package.json`：

```json
{
  "dependencies": {
    "@doiiarx/dsh-user-language": "link:<本插件目录绝对路径>"
  },

然后在 profile 目录 `pnpm install`。

@doiiarx/dsh-user-language README · 1. Mount into the web profile：In `$HOME/.dsh/profiles/web/package.json`:

```json
{
  "dependencies": {
    "@doiiarx/dsh-user-language": "link:<absolute path to this plugin directory>"
  },

Then run `pnpm install` in that profile directory.

